OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after deliberate fire
OL,4,Aat tenement flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested and charged
OL,7,Ffollowing a deliberate fire at tenement
OL,8,Fflats in Glasgow.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Ffire that broke out in a fourth-floor
OL,12,Fflat of a building on Stonyhurst
OL,13,FStreet, Possilpark last Sunday.
OL,15,FThe building had been empty for 20
OL,16,Fyears but had received funding to be
OL,17,Frenovated into affordable homes.
OL,19,FPolice said a 48-year-old man was
OL,20,Fcharged in connection with the fire and
OL,21,Fwill appear at Glasgow Sheriff Court on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
